(
  'whitney-pocket-gold-butte',
  'Whitney Pocket, Gold Butte National Monument',
  extensions.st_setsrid(extensions.st_makepoint(-114.13283, 36.52369), 4326)::extensions.geography,
  'dispersed',
  'BLM · Las Vegas Field Office (Gold Butte National Monument)',
  14,
  2,
  '2wd-ok',
  'About 21 miles of old, broken pavement with potholes and gravel patches. Go slow. Roads past Whitney Pocket need high clearance and 4WD.',
