  '2wd-ok',
  'US 97, then Jericho Lane. KOA says don''t let GPS route you on dirt roads from Hwy 26',
  null,
  true,
  true,
  true,
  70,
  true,
  true,
  null,
  null,
  array['electric', 'water', 'sewer']::text[],
  'reservable',
  'Prices vary by date and site; check koa.com. A camper paid $58 for a full-hookup pull-through in September 2024. 30 and 50 amp. Open all year. About 32 miles north of Bend.',
  array['Showers', 'Laundry', 'Pool (seasonal, saltwater)', 'Camp store', 'Wi-Fi', 'Dog park', 'Propane', 'Firewood', 'Playground', 'Cabins', 'Dump station']::text[],
  array['Check in 2 pm, check out 12 pm', 'Quiet hours 10 pm to 7 am', 'Pets on a leash at all times except in the off-leash area', '5 mph speed limit in the park', 'Tents only in the tent area or on RV pads, not on the grass at RV sites', 'No fireworks']::text[],
  'On US 97, 32 miles north of Bend, 16 miles north of Redmond, or 7 miles south of Madras. At mile marker 105, turn east on Jericho Lane. Coming from the east on Hwy 26, navigate to N44.502203, W121.178515 so GPS does not send you down dirt roads.',
  '(541) 546-3046',
  '[{"label":"KOA: Redmond / Central Oregon KOA Holiday","url":"https://koa.com/campgrounds/redmond/"},{"label":"KOA: Redmond general information","url":"https://koa.com/campgrounds/redmond/general-information/"},{"label":"KOA: Redmond amenities","url":"https://koa.com/campgrounds/redmond/amenities/"},{"label":"Campendium: Redmond - Central Oregon KOA","url":"https://maps.campendium.com/us/culver-or/camping-rv/redmond-central-oregon-koa"}]'::jsonb,
