  'not-needed',
  'Free dispersed camping. No water, toilets or trash service.',
  array['Rock fire ring', 'Spy Rock overlook and Redding Loop Trail nearby', 'Mulberry River nearby']::text[],
  array['Stay up to 30 days in a row, then move your camp at least 1 mile away for 14 days', 'No more than 90 days a year camping in the general forest area', 'Check county burn bans and fire danger before you light a fire', 'Pack out all trash', 'Bears live here: store food in your vehicle']::text[],
  'From I-40 exit 35 at Ozark, take AR 23 north about 15 miles to just past Cass, then turn east on AR 215 toward Redding Recreation Area. Morgan Mountain Road (FR 1504) heads north from AR 215; the campsite is a large clearing a little over a mile up, set 30–40 yards off the road. Only part of it is level. Farther north, a landslide closed FR 1504 between Lumpkin Creek Road (FR 1538) and Beech Grove Road (FR 1533) in 2025; this spot is south of that stretch.',
  '(479) 754-2864',
  '[{"label":"The Dyrt: Morgan Mtn Rd/Spy Rock Dispersed","url":"https://thedyrt.com/camping/arkansas/morgan-mtn-rd-spy-rock-dispersed-ozark-national-forest-ar"},{"label":"Forest Service: Morgan Mtn Rd partially closed for road repair","url":"https://www.fs.usda.gov/r08/ozark-stfrancis/alerts/morgan-mtn-rd-partially-closed-road-repair"},{"label":"Forest Service: Ozark-St. Francis occupancy and use order","url":"https://fs.usda.gov/r08/ozark-stfrancis/alerts/forest-order-occupancy-and-use"},{"label":"Forest Service: Redding Recreation Area","url":"https://www.fs.usda.gov/r08/ozark-stfrancis/recreation/redding-recreation-area"},{"label":"onX Offroad: Morgan Mountain Road","url":"https://www.onxmaps.com/offroad/trails/us/arkansas/morgan-mountain-road-jn2qvd2xxq95"},{"label":"Ark-Ok Hiker: Redding Loop/Spy Rock Trail","url":"https://arkokhiker.org/west-ark/redding-loop-spy-rock-hike-ozark-forest/"}]'::jsonb,
