(
  'clarion-river-campsites-allegheny',
  'Clarion River Campsites',
  extensions.st_setsrid(extensions.st_makepoint(-79.00694, 41.35974), 4326)::extensions.geography,
  'dispersed',
  'Allegheny National Forest · Marienville Ranger District',
  14,
  2,
  '2wd-ok',
  'Gravel River Road with light traffic. Each site has a hardened parking spot',
  null,
  true,
  true,
  true,
  null,
  false,
  null,
  0,
  null,
  '{}'::text[],
  'not-needed',
  'Free. 27 numbered primitive sites (18 along the Clarion River, 9 along Millstone Creek), first come, first served. No drinking water or picnic tables.',
  array['Rock fire ring at each site', 'Vault toilets at the Irwin Run, Robin Island and Millstone Creek launches', 'Clarion Wild and Scenic River: paddling and fishing']::text[],
  array['Camp only at the numbered sites; no other camping in this area', 'Occupy your site the first night and every 24 hours after. Leaving gear doesn''t hold a site', 'Stay up to 14 days in any 30 days, then leave the Allegheny NF until the 30 days are up', 'Up to 8 people per site', 'Fires only in the fire ring. Burn dead and down wood, and only firewood from Warren, McKean, Forest or Elk County', 'Dogs on a 6 ft leash, and inside the tent at night', 'Pack out all trash. Don''t burn trash in the fire rings']::text[],
  'Along River Road and Millstone Road (FR 132) between Irwin Run and Millstone Creek. From Marienville, take South Forest Street (SR 3002) about 6 miles to Loleta, cross Millstone Creek and turn onto Millstone Road. From Cook Forest, take River Road east from PA 36. From I-80, take exit 73 (eastbound) or 78 (westbound) and follow signs to PA 949 and River Road. A kiosk on River Road maps the sites. Park on the hardened spot, no more than 50 feet from the road.',
  '(814) 927-6628',
  '[{"label":"Forest Service: Clarion River Campsites","url":"https://www.fs.usda.gov/r09/allegheny/recreation/clarion-river-campsites"},{"label":"Forest Service: Allegheny occupancy limits order","url":"https://www.fs.usda.gov/r09/allegheny/alerts/forest-order-09-19-17-01-occupancy-limits"},{"label":"The Dyrt: Clarion River Campground","url":"https://thedyrt.com/camping/pennsylvania/clarion-river-campground"},{"label":"The Dyrt: Millstone Creek Campground","url":"https://thedyrt.com/camping/pennsylvania/millstone-creek-campground"}]'::jsonb,
  false,
  0
),
(
  'gatlinburg-east-smoky-mountain-koa-holiday',
  'Gatlinburg East / Smoky Mountain KOA Holiday',
  extensions.st_setsrid(extensions.st_makepoint(-83.25901, 35.77464), 4326)::extensions.geography,
  'campground',
  'KOA (private) · Gatlinburg East / Smoky Mountain KOA Holiday',
  null,
  1,
  '2wd-ok',
